## 3) Core modules cung cấp nền tảng (Provide)

Bạn nên đặt các `@Module @InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)` theo đúng “chủ sở hữu”:

### 3.1 `:core:database` — Room + DAO

**Gradle**

```kotlin
plugins {
  id("com.android.library")
  id("org.jetbrains.kotlin.android")
  id("com.google.dagger.hilt.android")
  kotlin("kapt")
  id("com.google.devtools.ksp")
}

dependencies {
  implementation(libs.hilt.android)
  kapt(libs.hilt.compiler)

  implementation(libs.room.runtime)
  implementation(libs.room.ktx)
  ksp(libs.room.compiler)
}
```

**DI module**

```kotlin
@Module
@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)
object DatabaseModule {

  @Provides
  @Singleton
  fun provideDb(@ApplicationContext context: Context): AppDatabase =
    Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, "expense.db")
      .addMigrations(/* MIGRATION_1_2, ... */)
      .build()

  @Provides
  fun provideExpenseDao(db: AppDatabase): ExpenseDao = db.expenseDao()

  @Provides
  fun provideTagDao(db: AppDatabase): TagDao = db.tagDao()
}
```

### 3.2 `:core:datastore` — DataStore

**Gradle**

```kotlin
plugins {
  id("com.android.library")
