## 4) Feature modules: bind Repository/UseCase + ViewModel

Mỗi feature thường có:

* Interface `Repository` (domain) và `Impl` (data)
* `@Binds` module để gắn interface -> impl
* `@HiltViewModel` cho VM

### 4.1 `:feature:expense/build.gradle.kts` (tương tự các feature khác)

```kotlin
plugins {
  id("com.android.library")
  id("org.jetbrains.kotlin.android")
  id("com.google.dagger.hilt.android")
  kotlin("kapt")
}

dependencies {
  implementation(project(":core:database"))
  implementation(project(":core:common"))
  implementation(project(":core:ui"))

  implementation(libs.hilt.android)
  kapt(libs.hilt.compiler)
  implementation(libs.hilt.nav.compose)
}
```

### 4.2 Bind repository trong feature

```kotlin
@Module
@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)
abstract class ExpenseBindings {

  @Binds
  @Singleton
  abstract fun bindExpenseRepository(
    impl: ExpenseRepositoryImpl
  ): ExpenseRepository
}
```

Repository impl có thể inject DAO:

```kotlin
class ExpenseRepositoryImpl @Inject constructor(
  private val expenseDao: ExpenseDao
) : ExpenseRepository { ... }
```

### 4.3 ViewModel

```kotlin
@HiltViewModel
class ExpenseViewModel @Inject constructor(
  private val repo: ExpenseRepository,
  savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle
) : ViewModel() { ... }
```

### 4.4 Compose screen lấy VM

```kotlin
@Composable
fun ExpenseListRoute(
  vm: ExpenseViewModel = androidx.hilt.navigation.compose.hiltViewModel()
) {
  val state by vm.state.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()
  ExpenseListScreen(state = state, onAction = vm::onAction)
}
```

