## 6) WorkManager + Hilt (cho nhắc nhở thanh toán)

Nếu bạn muốn **inject vào Worker**, cần thêm Hilt Work integration.

### 6.1 Dependencies bổ sung

* Thêm `androidx.hilt:hilt-work`
* Thêm compiler `androidx.hilt:hilt-compiler` (khác với `com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler`)

Ví dụ đặt vào `:feature:subscription` hoặc `:app` (nơi chứa Worker):

```kotlin
dependencies {
  implementation(libs.androidx.hilt.work)
  kapt(libs.androidx.hilt.compiler)

  implementation(libs.work.runtime)
}
```

### 6.2 Worker

```kotlin
@HiltWorker
class PaymentReminderWorker @AssistedInject constructor(
  @Assisted appContext: Context,
  @Assisted params: WorkerParameters,
  private val repo: SubscriptionRepository
) : CoroutineWorker(appContext, params) {

  override suspend fun doWork(): Result {
    // gửi notification, check kỳ thanh toán...
    return Result.success()
  }
}
```

### 6.3 Application cấu hình WorkerFactory

```kotlin
@HiltAndroidApp
class ExpenseApp : Application(), Configuration.Provider {

  @Inject lateinit var workerFactory: HiltWorkerFactory

  override val workManagerConfiguration: Configuration
    get() = Configuration.Builder()
      .setWorkerFactory(workerFactory)
      .build()
}
```

